==Russian==

===Etymology===
Compare to {{cog|sh|pomagati}}, {{cog|pl|pomagać}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|помога́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-помогать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|помога́ть|impf|pf=помо́чь}}

# to [[help]] {{+obj|ru|dat<whom>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[он|ему́]] '''помога́л'''.|I was '''helping''' him.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[aid]], to [[assist]] [[materially]] {{+obj|ru|dat<whom> + ins<with/using what>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[я|Я]] [[друг|дру́гу]] '''помога́ю''' [[деньги|де́ньгами]].|I'm '''helping''' a friend with money.}}
# {{lb|ru|impersonal}} to [[avail]], to [[work]] {{gloss|to have the desired effect}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[лекарство|Лека́рство]] '''помога́ет'''.|The medicine '''is helping'''.}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf-intr|1a|помога́ть}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|вспомога́тельный}}
* {{l|ru|подмо́га|g=f}}
* {{l|ru|помо́щник|tr=pomóšnik|g=m}}, {{l|ru|помо́щница|g=f}}
* {{l|ru|по́мощь|g=f}}
